#AREA Caverns of the Duorp~

#AUTHORS Rem~

#HELPS
-1 "DUORP" DUORP~
{120}Caverns of {134}Duorp{300} - {110}The {117}Drow{300} {110}Headquarters{300}.


{130}This is the Drow army headquarters. The sole purpose of the building of{300} 
{130}this headquarters is because of the war against the gnomes. In the{300}
{130}beginning, the gnomes are thought to be mere pests; like flies that kept{300} 
{130}buzzing around you. No actions were taken. Then the gnomes started killing{300} 
{130}innocent drows; murdering defenseless children destroying our homes. This{300} 
{130}act of terrorism against the people of the drows has forced the Drow High{300} 
{130}Command to take immediate action. General Norkras has been chosen to lead{300} 
{130}the expedition. A crude but useful cavern system has been set up to{300} 
{130}meet the needs of the army. General Norkras is known for his brilliance in{300} 
{130}battle as well as a great fighter. He has been in many wars, such as the{300} 
{130}great Kasha War where General Norkras, against all odds have successfully{300} 
{130}neutralize the foe and even totally eliminated them. With General{300} 
{130}Norkras, as the commander in charge, we will triumph against the evil{300} 
{130}that is done by the gnomes. We will win.{300}



  {135}(A){300} {117}Extras...{300}
  {135}(B){300} {117}IMPORTANT{130} things you need to know when you're in the army.{300}





{b}DUORP2
{a}DUORP1
{-}GAMEAREA1
~
-1 DUORP1~
{117}Extras...{300}


{130}Ok, firstly, this area is design to help lowbies and even newbies that{300} 
{130}have decided to fight for a great cause. Without players like you, there{300} 
{130}will not be an army, thus there will not be any fun. So I hope that drows{300} 
{130}like yourself will join the army and enrich the role playing in this mud.{300} 
{130}Well that's all I have to say for now. Hope you enjoy what this little{300} 
{130}area has to offer. :>{300}~
-1 DUORP2~
{117}IMPORTANT{300} {120}things you need to know when you're in the army.{300}
{120}          (well, some of it anyways...){300}


{150}Well, this is just a quick fix reminder for those who are joining the{300} 
{150}army. This list is compiled with pointers I think would help a newbie{300} 
{150}adjust himself in race war.{300} {142}Good Luck!{300}

   {174}1.{300} {120}Race war starts at {135}LEVEL 10{300}
   {174}2.{300} {135}DROWS FIGHT GNOMES.{300} {120}Remember that for it may save your life.{300}
   {174}3.{300} {120}type {135}ARMY GNOME{300} {120}for foe and {135}ARMY{300} {120}for friend.{300}
   {174}4.{300} {135}Don't need to pay to join the army.(unless you have some to spare){300}
   {174}5.{300} {120}If any gnome army appear in your {135}WHO{300} {120}list, they can whack you and{300} 
      {120}so can you whack them.{135}So DON'T complain if you are WHACKED{300} {120}while{300} 
      {120}leveling {135}"peacefully".{300} {120}The choice is yours.{300}
   {174}6.{300} {120}If you have a {135}(KILLER) flag{300}{120}, you die, you lose 2x exp. {135}NO excuse.{300}
   {174}7.{300} {135}Once you quit from the army, you're quit for good.{300} {120}You can only{300} 
      {120}join back in your next life. {135}So make up your mind.{300}
   {174}8.{300} {120}For a complete list of help on race war, type {135}HELP{300} {120}then choose{300} 
      {135}(E){300} {120}then {135}(W){120}. I'm sure you know how to use {135}HELP.{300}~
-1 DUORP3~
{110}-<{130}<(>{140}*{171}<{PULVERIZED}>{140}*{130}<)>{110}>-{300}   {110}Y{160}O{120}U{130}!!!{300}~
0 $~

#RANGES 0 99 0 99

