#16302
Commander Arika~
Commander Arika~
You see a handsome young drow here.~
Even Don Juan has to bow to this young drow. He's the master in the art of 
love. ALL the women, whomever met him, married or not, will find him 
irresistible. If you are female, you better save yourself the pain and give 
in to him because if he wants you... you know it in your heart that he'll 
sweep you off this universe... :>~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_STAY_AREA|ACT_TRAIN|ACT_SMART|ACT_NO_ORDER|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE
AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_DETECT_HIDDEN|AFF_SANCTUARY|AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_TONGUES
0 S
60 BODY_TORSO BODY_LEG|BODY_ARM|BODY_HAND 1d1+9999 1d1+99
100000 RACE_DROW
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>all_greet_prog 80~
if ispc($n)
  if sex($n) <= 1
    smile $n
  else
    say Ah... lady of high born, maiden of this universe,
    say how long have I waited for thee! Come my lovely, 
    say be with me and I shall show you the nectar of
    say euphoria... :)
    mpmset $i quest 0 6 30
    break
  endif
endif
~
>rand_prog 60~
if quest (0,6,$i) == 30
  say Do you know what is "Dong,Dong,Dong...Dong,Dong?"
  say Guess not...
  mpmset $i quest 0 6 29
  break
endif
if quest (0,6,$i) == 29
  mpecho ...You here background music starting...
  emote sings 'Oh oh Oh Onlllyyyy YOUOOUOUOUO...
  mpecho ...background vocal : onlyyouonlyyouonlyyou...
  emote sings 'Can blow my mind like that...
  mpmset $i quest 0 6 28
  break
endif
if quest (0,6,$i) == 28
  emote sings 'Onlyyyy YOUOUOOUO...
  mpecho ...background vocal : youyouyouyou...
  emote sings 'Can bring my brother back...
  mpmset $i quest 0 6 27
  break
endif
if quest (0,6,$i) == 27
  emote sings 'Only yooooouuu...
  mpecho ...wolf bays : Aaaauuuooooooo...
  emote sings 'I love, with all my heart...
  emote sings 'Can stitch my boxers up...
  mpecho ...from the background, you hear boxers been torn apart...
  mpmset $i quest 0 6 26
  break
endif
if quest (0,6,$i) == 26
  emote sings 'The only one that can do all that...
  mpecho ...you hear cats fighting in the background...
  emote sings' that is OH oh Oh only YOUoooo...
  mpecho ...now more cats are fighting in the background...
  mpmset $i quest 0 6 25
  break
endif
if quest (0,6,$i) == 25
  sigh 
  emote takes a deep breath...
  emote ...and slowly exhale...
  mpmset $i quest 0 6 24
  break
endif
if quest (0,6,$i) == 24
  emote sings 'Oh oh oH Only YOUuouo...
  mpecho . o O (bet you think the singing is over..)
  emote sings 'Can ...
  emote looks up into the ceiling...
  mpmset $i quest 0 6 23
  break
endif
if quest (0,6,$i) == 23
  mpecho ...suddenly some cats came flying out of no where...
  mpecho ...SMACK!...
  mpecho landed flat on Arika's face!
  mpecho ...Hopefully, Commander Arika won't sing anymore.. :)
  groan 
  mpmset $i quest 0 6 0
  break
endif
~
|
