#16308
Commander Odrus~
Commander Odrus~
A beefy looking drow is here.~
He's Mr. Universe redefined. He's everything physical a guy wanna be. He's 
every woman's secret dream. No doubt that he can kill you with a sneeze or 
perhaps a laugh. Nevertheless, you feel safe knowing that he's on your 
side.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_STAY_AREA|ACT_SMART|ACT_NO_ORDER|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE
AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_DETECT_HIDDEN|AFF_SANCTUARY|AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_TONGUES
0 S
95 BODY_TORSO BODY_LEG|BODY_ARM|BODY_HAND 1d1+9999 1d1+99
100000 RACE_DROW
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>all_greet_prog 100~
if ispc($n)
  if race($n) == 3
    if level($n) < 10
      say Come back when you grow some whiskers kid.
      mpecho Commander Odrus picks you up with his pinky and...
      say 3...2...1 Up up and away!
      mpecho You flew, tumbling in the air and landed on Chakkor!
      mptransfer $n 9755
      mpecho OUCH! Your behind hurts...
      break
    else
      say Show your patriotism by joining the army.
      say Be all that you can be; kick those gnome scums' a**es!
      say What do you say eh?
      say Right here and right now!
      say C'mon yellow belly... I D-A-R-E YOU!
      break
    endif
  else
    if race($n) == 5
      say Punk you've got guts coming here.
      say I give you that. HOWEVER... Face the omnipotent power
      say of the Drow Army. Remember my name and FEAR ME
      say GNOME SCUM! For you shall suffer!
      mptransfer $n 9755
      mpat 9755 mpechoaround $n HUMILIATION COMBO!
      mpat 9755 mpforce $n remove all
      mpat 9755 mpechoat $n YOU ARE STRIPPED NAKED!
      mpat 9755 mpmset $n long A GNOME SCUM is here!
      mpat 9755 mpforce $n shout I'M A GNOME SCUM! SCUMS OF ALL SCUMS!
      mpat 9755 mpforce $n chat I'M A GNOME SCUM! SCUMS OF ALL SCUMS! 
      break
    else
      say Punk this is no place for you. GET OUT OF MY FACE!
      mpecho Gives you the kick of your life time!
      mpecho THUD!
      mpecho You've landed in Chakkor!
      mptransfer $n 9755
      mpat 9755 mpforce $n shout I WILL NOT SPY FOR GNOME SCUMS ANYMORE!
      break
    endif
  endif
endif
~
|
#16309
General Norkras~
General Norkras~
General Norkras of the Drow Army is here.~
He's tall and lean. Cloak that he wears is dark and silky. His drow semi 
plate armor is polished and trimmed with gold markings of the Drow Royal 
Army. Jutting out of his cloak, is his drow sword. You wouldn't want to 
be the one who would witness the drawing of his sword however, you do 
have to admit that the sword is very well made and of the best design.~
