#ROOMS
#16300
Magical Cavern~
Though this cavern, like any cavern you have been in, is dark and damp, 
when you look closely, you find that the cave walls consist of multi hue 
rocks and minerals. Some of them even emits a faint greenish glow in the 
dark. The sound and ultimately, the echo of water drops hitting the cave 
floors gives you a sense of being all alone by yourself. Occasionally, 
you would feel gust of gentle breeze lapping on your face. However, you 
cannot detect any exits that leads into the outside world.~
