S
#16301
Large Cavern~
You have come into a dimly lit cavern that is more spacious than the 
others you have seen so far. Numerous drows that remains faceless to you, 
moves in and out of this cavern. It is very obvious to you that this 
cavern is enlarged by means of tools, not of natural cause. Stalagmites 
and stalactites that met together have been carved into pillars of 
intricate design that is lost in antiquity. Voices kept echoing throughout 
this spacious cave as members of the drow army practice and sharpened 
their skills in the struggle against the gnomes.~
