#16302
Largest Cavern~
This is the largest cavern you have encounter so far in your exploration 
of this make shift head quarters of the drow army. You see several drows 
grunt and sweat as they train hard and train for victory against the 
gnomes. Off into the south side of this cavern, you can immediately detect a 
miniature faucet that constantly has water running out of it; to sooth 
the thirst of those who trained hard.~
