#16303
Dark Cavern~
Although this cave is dark and maybe just a little small, there is quite 
a few drows to be found here. Most of the drows you found here dresses in 
white or partly white. You have also noticed badly worn stretchers are 
placed neatly on the side of the cave wall. As you walk deeper into this 
cavern, you have also noticed that the drows you have met here are mostly 
grim faced. As you approached the end of the cave, you realize that just 
ahead of you lies the bodies of the ones who lost their lives in battle. 
You instinctively brought your hand to your mouth as you try to fight of 
the nausea you feel.~
