Spacious Tunnel~
As you walk down this tunnel, you find that this tunnel floor actually 
has more dirt that it should have. This puzzled you greatly as the caves 
that you have come across so far are limestone caves. Towards where the 
end of the wall meet the floor, weird fungus and mushrooms actually grows 
here. On top of that, they actually give a soft glow too.~
