Small Cave~
You have noticed that this cave is enlarged so that this cave can be put 
to a better use rather than leaving it as a tunnel. A small underground 
stream meanders though this cave as you walk across a beautifully crafted 
little bridge of drow design. You noticed a stall that sells drinks are 
set up in the far end corner of the cave. You wonder if the drinks sold 
here is safe to drink. :>~
