#16306
Grand Cavern~
You have never been in a cave that is so called grand, however, this is 
as close a cave as being called grand. Stairs that leads to other parts 
of this complex is literally carved into the slopes of the caves. Make 
shift chandeliers, though looks crude, gives out a gentle glow that is 
very dim. Of the four corners of this caverns, are placed four little 
cauldrons each corner, that seems to burn forever. The walls of the cave 
are so smooth that you shudder at the time an effort spent on polishing 
those walls. Brass slabs were placed onto the walls, containing names of 
the those who lost their lives valiantly in war. You feel a sense of 
nostalgia, as when you stood on the highest part of the cavern, looking 
at this magnificent architect of the drows.~
