#16307
Wide Cavern~
This cavern is converted into a mess hall where all the drows have their 
meals here. This cave is so huge that those long benches and tables that 
filled it are capable to cater thousands of drows in any given time. 
Right as of now, this cave is sparsely filled. Cooks and helpers are 
constantly busy preparing food whenever it is not meal time and after 
meals, they are busy cleaning. On the right hand corner of the counter, 
located a small stall that has a sign that says that it is opened twenty 
four hours a day. The reason for the mess hall to open twenty four hours 
a day is probably due to the fact that wars, unlike work, ignores time. 
Wars only end when one of the party or parties succeed in obtaining 
whatever it desires; at whatever the costs.~
