#16310
Cavern Center~
Behold! The center of the Caverns of the Duorp. Directly in the center 
of this hall lies a monolith carved out of some kind of black marble. 
The inscriptions that filled all the four sides of the monolith, looks 
incomprehensible, however you guessed it is probably lore of the drows 
passed down generation by generation. A sword as black as a moonless 
night, floats magically above this monolith. The sword is sleek in 
design, unlike human made sword, it is thin and long; almost a stabbing 
weapon rather than slashing weapon. On all the four diagonal corners of 
the monolith, about seven feet away, stood four different statues. 
Probably statues of war heroes that were lost in the legends. This 
grand hall is linked by the four great stairways, north, south, east 
and west of you. Of a ways from the center of this hall lies a helix 
shaped stairways that goes up and down.~
