can see that it used to be a cave.However it is meticulously transformed 
into a hall. Ceremonial armors and weapons filled this hall and you are 
mildly surprised by the fact that there is not even a speck of dust 
found on those armors and weapons. The ceiling of this hall is polished 
and tales of the struggle between the drows and the gnomes were carved 
on.~
