#16315
Cavern of Arms~
Sounds of hammer beating on metal is reverberating throughout this 
cavern. Immediately you identify this cavern either belong to a weapon 
smith or and armor smith. The only visible light source is from the 
furnace. You can barely detect the silhouette of a drow working on a 
piece of red hot metal. Nevertheless this is the only cavern that you 
find that is almost filled with racks upon racks of weapons of assorted 
nature. On the far east corner of this cavern, three blacksmiths are busy
hammering alloys into blades, daggers, and more... all of which produces 
a deadly gleam.~
