#16319
Cavern of Ysird~
Right as you enter this cavern, you found a statue of a drow placed 
exactly on the center. As you look at the plaque that is embedded below 
the statue. The plaque explains that this cavern is dedicated to Ysird 
the drow necromancer for playing a major role of repelling an invasion 
by the gnomes. Sadly Ysird died due to over exhaustion after casting 
the crucial spell. After this incident, this cavern, not only does is 
it dedicated to Ysird but also being converted into a school of magic. 
So that magical scrolls can be scribed and potions to be brewed to help 
in the war effort.~
